# Testing

- Unskip `describe.skip` on `src/api/__tests__/api.test.js` once `getData` works. Do not rewrite those five tests.
- Keep the three VehicleList `data-testid` cases (`loading` / `error` / `results`).
- Add tests for behaviour we introduce: empty list, merged `description`/`meta`, image helper, modal open/close/reopen, retry if we add it.
